From b9b14efbac6ead0c3db0a581c981e4dfc09c9776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gebinbin <gebinbin@contributor>

Date: Mon, 5 Jan 2026 10:01:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix temporary table query crash

Issue:
---------
[internal-git-removed]
add tuple==nullptr condition is wrong, it makes temporary query return too early and make some cases
crash or hang when combine with ptrc.

Solution:
---------
optimize judge condition and add test cases ensure.Meanwhile add more temporary judge,
Optimization and unification are required in the internal temporary tables.
